  please cite it using the metadata below.

title: >-
  Stratified Differential Evolution Ensemble Regression with
  Leak-Guarded Bayesian Optimization for Regulatory-Grade
  Prediction of Industrial Toxic Chemical Releases: A
  SHAP-Interpreted Analysis of EPA Toxics Release Inventory 2022

authors:
  - family-names: "M B"
    given-names: "Sourav"
